'''MIBR''' (also known as '''Made in Brazil''') is a [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] esports organization based in [[wikipedia:São Paulo|São Paulo]]. 

On October 24, 2025, MIBR was acquired by [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] tech media company Spun Mídia, MIBR and [[LOS]] will sit under the newly created esports division, EZOR. <ref name="Spun Mídia">{{cite web|url=https://esportsradar.gg/spun-midia-acquires-mibr-and-launches-ezor-brand-house/|title=Spun Mídia acquires MIBR and launches EZOR brand house|date=2025-10-24|publisher='''The Esports Radar'''|author='''[[Victor Frascarelli]]'''}}</ref>

